WEBVTT

00:02:59.926 --> 00:03:02.261
But it’s in a dilemma of its own doing,

00:03:02.261 --> 00:03:05.765
trapped in a cloud of its own
suffocating slime.

00:03:05.932 --> 00:03:07.683
So what does it do?

00:03:07.683 --> 00:03:10.645
Well, it ties itself in a knot, of course.

00:03:10.645 --> 00:03:13.314
Starting at its tail 
and passing its body through,

00:03:13.314 --> 00:03:17.109
the hagfish effectively wipes away
its own slime.

00:03:17.360 --> 00:03:20.321
Apparently unfazed by the whole encounter,

00:03:20.321 --> 00:03:22.490
it returns to its meal.

00:03:22.490 --> 00:03:25.368
When it gets to a tougher part 
of the carcass...

00:03:25.368 --> 00:03:29.538
Voila! The hagfish ties itself 
in yet another knot

00:03:29.538 --> 00:03:32.541
to gain leverage and yank off the meat.